```js
function buildSuggester(entries, k) {
  const newNode = () => ({ children: new Map(), top: [] });
  const root = newNode();
  const offer = (node, q, c) => {
    node.top.push({ q, c });
    node.top.sort((a, b) => b.c - a.c || a.q.localeCompare(b.q));
    if (node.top.length > k) node.top.pop();
  };
  for (const [q, c] of entries) {
    let node = root;
    offer(node, q, c);
    for (const ch of q) {
      if (!node.children.has(ch)) node.children.set(ch, newNode());
      node = node.children.get(ch);
      offer(node, q, c);
    }
  }
  return function suggest(prefix) {
    let node = root;
    for (const ch of prefix) {
      node = node.children.get(ch);
      if (!node) return [];
    }
    return node.top.map((t) => t.q);
  };
}
```

**Where the time goes:** the server's 2 ms is negligible. A keystroke-to-pixels budget of ~100 ms is spent on **network round trips** (20–50 ms each, more on mobile) plus any **debounce** delay. A 300 ms debounce alone blows the budget.

**Why it flickers:** responses can arrive **out of order**. You type `sys`, then `syst`; the `sys` reply arrives last and overwrites the correct list.

**Client fixes**
- Drop stale responses: abort the previous request, or ignore replies whose prefix isn't the current input.

```js
let controller;
async function suggest(prefix) {
  controller?.abort();                       // cancel the older request
  controller = new AbortController();
  const res = await fetch(`/suggest?q=${encodeURIComponent(prefix)}`, { signal: controller.signal });
  const list = await res.json();
  if (input.value === prefix) render(list);  // only show answers for what's typed now
}
```
(Callers should catch the `AbortError` that a cancelled fetch throws.)

- **Cache per prefix** in the browser (a `Map`), so backspacing or retyping needs no network.
- Use a **short debounce** (~50 ms), and optionally **prefetch** likely next prefixes.

**Edge fixes**
- Serve popular short prefixes from a **CDN edge** near the user with `Cache-Control: max-age=…`, cutting a 50+ ms round trip to around 10 ms.
